WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:11.441
One day, Daddy said, "Let's go fishing tomorrow.

2
00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:13.955
I will teach you how to fish."

3
00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:17.822
I could hardly wait until morning!

4
00:00:17.823 --> 00:00:21.676
In the morning, Daddy and I drove to a shop.

5
00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:29.146
We bought some hooks, some floats, some worms, and some fishing line too.

6
00:00:29.147 --> 00:00:31.316
Then we went to the dock.

7
00:00:31.317 --> 00:00:33.824
The boat rocked as we climbed in.

8
00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:39.361
Daddy started the motor. Vroom!

9
00:00:39.362 --> 00:00:45.309
Daddy helped me tie the hook, the sinker, and the float to my fishing line.

10
00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:50.882
"Daddy, let's put this worm on the hook," I said.

11
00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:54.455
"This worm will catch a big fish!"

12
00:00:54.456 --> 00:00:58.470
Daddy helped me throw my fishing line into the water.

13
00:00:58.471 --> 00:01:02.806
"Whirr," went the fishing rod.

14
00:01:02.807 --> 00:01:07.547
"Now, we must wait for the fish to bite," Daddy said.

15
00:01:07.548 --> 00:01:09.618
We waited and waited.

16
00:01:09.619 --> 00:01:14.144
But the fish did not bite.

17
00:01:14.145 --> 00:01:15.978
Soon it got cold.

18
00:01:15.979 --> 00:01:18.190
We waited some more.

19
00:01:18.191 --> 00:01:21.094
"Daddy, I am bored.

20
00:01:21.095 --> 00:01:25.700
I am cold too," I said.

21
00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:29.737
Then a big fishing boat passed by.

22
00:01:29.738 --> 00:01:35.859
"Someday, I will have a big fishing boat too!" I told my dad.

23
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:41.917
"I will sail far out on the ocean and catch all kinds of fish.

24
00:01:41.918 --> 00:01:46.123
I will catch the biggest fish in the world!"

25
00:01:46.124 --> 00:01:50.103
"Look, you have a bite!" said Daddy.

26
00:01:50.104 --> 00:01:53.969
My float was bouncing up and down in the water.

27
00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:59.072
"Oh no!" I said. "I cannot pull it in!"

28
00:01:59.073 --> 00:02:03.046
Daddy helped me slowly reel in the fish.

29
00:02:03.047 --> 00:02:07.956
"Look, Daddy! I caught this fish all by myself!

30
00:02:07.957 --> 00:02:12.877
Now I am a real fisherman!" I said.

31
00:02:12.878 --> 00:02:16.578
"Yes, you are!" agreed Daddy.

32
00:02:16.579 --> 00:02:19.251
"But this fish is very small.

33
00:02:19.252 --> 00:02:20.748
Let it grow up.

34
00:02:20.749 --> 00:02:23.900
We can catch it later when it grows bigger."

35
00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:26.302
So we let the fish go.

36
00:02:26.303 --> 00:02:30.846
It quickly swam away in the water.

37
00:02:30.847 --> 00:02:35.647
"Daddy, when can we go fishing again?" I asked.

38
00:02:35.648 --> 00:02:39.128
"We can go next Sunday," he said.

39
00:02:39.129 --> 00:02:44.592
"Oh yes! I can't wait to go fishing again!" I said.

40
00:02:44.593 --> 00:02:48.088
The fishing trip was a lot of fun!
